    "description": "COMP3123 Assignment 1 — Employee Management API.\n\nRun the API locally on port 3000. Execute POST - Login (User A) and POST - Login User B to populate the corresponding JWT variables before testing protected requests. Employee IDs are test-database document IDs and may need updating if the database is reset. To run GET - Invalid JWT, set invalid_jwt locally to a deliberately invalid value (e.g. invalid.jwt.token). To run GET - Expired JWT, generate an expired test token locally and set expired_jwt; do not export working tokens. Some POST signup/create requests will return conflicts if their test records already exist. DELETE permanently removes its target; re-create a test employee before rerunning it. For ownership tests, authenticate User A and User B separately."
  },
